<doc id="191884" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=191884" title="Aniplex">
Aniplex

Aniplex Inc. (株式会社アニプレックス, Kabushiki-gaisha Anipurekkusu) yaiku sawijining perusahaan produksi &lt;a href="anime"&gt;anime&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; Jepang sing diduweni dening &lt;a href="Sony%20Music%20Entertainment%20Japan"&gt;Sony Music Entertainment Japan&lt;/a&gt;. Didegaké ing September 1995, Aniplex wis melu produksi lan distribusi sawetara seri anime, kayata &lt;a href="Fullmetal%20Alchemist%20%28seri%20TV%29"&gt;Fullmetal Alchemist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sword%20Art%20Online"&gt;Sword Art Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puella%20Magi%20Madoka%20Magica"&gt;Puella Magi Madoka Magica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fate/Grand%20Order"&gt;Fate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Monogatari%20%28seri%29"&gt;Seri Monogatari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Angel%20Beats%21"&gt;Angel Beats!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Promised%20Neverland"&gt;The Promised Neverland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rurouni%20Kenshin%20%28seri%20TV%29"&gt;Rurouni Kenshin&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. Kajaba iku, Aniplex produksi lan nyebarake rekaman &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="soundtrack"&gt;soundtrack&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu soundtrack asli kanggo kabeh komputer lan video game &lt;a href="Sony%20Interactive%20Entertainment"&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit 2010-an, Aniplex uga melu produksi lan nerbitake video game.
Aniplex uga melu ritel merchandise, produksi dolanan, game, &lt;a href="alat%20nulis"&gt;alat nulis&lt;/a&gt;, panganan lan barang-barang liyane sing nduweni karakter populer. Kajaba iku, Aniplex nggawe acara kanggo promosi franchise anime. Contone, ing taun 2005 Aniplex nganakake Festival Alchemist Fullmetal sing diwiwiti kanthi Tur Alchemist Fullmetal ing &lt;a href="Universal%20Studios%20Japan"&gt;Universal Studios Japan&lt;/a&gt;.
Aniplex minangka anggota lengkap &lt;a href="The%20Association%20of%20Japanese%20Animations"&gt;The Association of Japanese Animations&lt;/a&gt; lan anggota Japan Video Software Association.
