<doc id="192063" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=192063" title="Kyushu Shinkansen">
Kyushu Shinkansen

Kyushu Shinkansen (九州新幹線, Kyūshū Shinkansen) yaiku jalur jaringan &lt;a href="sepur"&gt;sepur&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; Jepang. Iku minangka perpanjangan saka &lt;a href="San%27y%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;San'yō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Honshu"&gt;Honshu&lt;/a&gt;, sing nyambungake kutha &lt;a href="Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Stasiun%20Hakata"&gt;Stasiun Hakata&lt;/a&gt;) ing sisih lor Pulo &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt; Jepang menyang kutha &lt;a href="Kagoshima"&gt;Kagoshima&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Stasiun%20Kagoshima-Chuo"&gt;Stasiun Kagoshima-Chuo&lt;/a&gt;) ing sisih kidul. Jalur kasebut sejajar karo &lt;a href="Jalur%20Utama%20Kagoshima"&gt;Jalur Utama Kagoshima&lt;/a&gt; sing ana lan dioperasikake dening &lt;a href="Kyushu%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Kyushu Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR Kyushu).
<h2>Rute</h2>
<h3>Rute Kagoshima</h3>
Rute.
Rute Kagoshima.
Konstruksi saka Rute Kagoshima (鹿児島ルート, Rute Kagoshima) diwiwiti ing taun 1991, lan segmen kapisan antarane Kagoshima lan &lt;a href="Yatsushiro"&gt;Shin-Yatsushiro&lt;/a&gt; dibukak ing 13 Maret 2004. Bagean awal iki nyuda wektu lelungan antarane rong kutha saka 2 jam 10 menit dadi 35 menit lan nyuda wektu antarane Hakata lan Kagoshima saka 4 jam dadi 2 jam. Nalika kabeh jalur wis rampung, wektu lelungan saka Hakata menyang Kagoshima luwih suda dadi kira-kira 1 jam 20 menit. Ing 2012, kacepetan jalur maksimum punika 260 km/h antarane Hakata dan Kagoshima. Kaya kabeh jalur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, Kyushu Shinkansen nggunakake sepur standar.
Layanan &lt;a href="Sakura%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Sakura&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mizuho%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Mizuho&lt;/a&gt; kerep dioperasikake menyang &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Stasiun Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt; liwat &lt;a href="San%27y%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;San'yō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;. Sepur sing kabeh mandheg kabeh dijenengi &lt;a href="Tsubame%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Tsubame&lt;/a&gt; ("Ngulu"), jeneng tilas layanan &lt;a href="ekspres%20winates"&gt;ekspres winates&lt;/a&gt; Hakata-Kagoshima, lan mung dipotong menyang Kyushu Shinkansen.
<h3>Rute Nishi Kyushu (Nagasaki)</h3>
Rute Nishi Kyushu (Nagasaki).
Jalur Shinkansen saka Fukuoka nganti Nagasaki, wiwitane dikenal minangka Nagasaki Shinkansen (長崎新幹線, Nagasaki Shinkansen), ditata ing Rencana Dasar 1973. Ganti jeneng dadi Rute Nagasaki (長崎ルート, Rute Nagasaki), banjur diganti dadi Rute Nishi Kyushu (西九州ルート, Nishi Kyūshū rūto)' ing taun 1995, segmen antara &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Takeo-Onsen"&gt;Takeo-Onsen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nagasaki"&gt;Nagasaki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nishi%20Kyushu%20Shinkansen"&gt;Nishi Kyushu Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, dibukak kanggo layanan ing 23 September 2022.
<h3>Rute liyane sing direncanakake</h3>
Rute liyane sing direncanakake.
Miturut Rencana Dasar Shinkansen sing ditata ing taun 1973, rong rute liyane bakal ngiringi rute Kagoshima lan West Kyushu (Nagasaki): East Kyushu Shinkansen, saka Hakata menyang Kagoshima-Chūō liwat &lt;a href="%C5%8Cita%20%28kutha%29"&gt;Ōita&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Miyazaki%20%28kutha%29"&gt;Miyazaki&lt;/a&gt;, padha karo &lt;a href="Jalur%20Utama%20Nipp%C5%8D"&gt;Jalur Utama Nippō&lt;/a&gt;; lan Trans-Kyushu Shinkansen, nyambungake &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kumamoto"&gt;Kumamoto&lt;/a&gt; lan Ōita, lan nyambungake karo Shikoku Shinkansen sing uga direncanakake menyang &lt;a href="Matsuyama"&gt;Matsuyama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Takamatsu"&gt;Takamatsu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt;. Rencana-rencana kasebut wis ditundha tanpa wates lan ora bakal ditimbang maneh nganti jalur Shinkansen sing wis dibangun rampung.
